        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlXSrg3rIcrQes47CHIpwtlAaMN-jgJ6JXMb1pGtJAX-FArg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I've been seeing Carina for the past year and she's been so professional and dedicated during my healing journey. She always goes above and beyond! The rest of the staff is a joy to be with as well! Ten stars out of five!!",
