      },
      {
        "author_name": "fuwad mohamed",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107928581687126239901/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI4mZvwZiXGMq_5-i2yB20YPVnA3YCpaUiLzAw02oG50iFPFA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve had an amazing experience at Physiothérapie Universelle. Alex, my physiotherapist, is incredibly knowledgeable, supportive, and genuinely cares about his patients. He explains things clearly and tailors each session to your needs, making real progress feel achievable. Barria, my occupational therapist, is kind, attentive, and truly skilled,she’s helped me regain function and confidence. The front desk staff are also fantastic, always friendly and welcoming. The whole team creates a professional yet warm environment. I highly recommend them!",
